  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Yep so I figured out the audio bug issue. If you're playing in Offline mode on Steam, you will not be able to hear anyone in game, for whatever reasons. The update must have changed this because prior to it, I could play in offline mode on steam and everything worked, however if I play in offline mode on steam now, I cannot hear anyone. Switching to online mode in Steam fixes this, and allows me to hear everyone the way it should. So for those of you experiencing this, try switching to online mode in steam. Hope this helps. And hopefully there's an easy fix next patch to make it so offline mode doesn't mess with audio. \n\nI've been told it may have to do with the update enabling Steam Voice, which if you are in offline mode on steam, this would cause it to break. \n\nThanks for reading!",
